  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FEP GY0055 - Programa de Manejo de Desechos Slidos de Georgetown</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF GY0055 - Georgetown Solid Waste Management Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To assist the GoG in completing: the environmental requirements to close the old solid waste dumpsite at Mandela avenue, and the engineering designs for the Eccles sanitary landfill required for the processing of the Georgetown Solid Waste Management Program. The objective of this project is to improve the environmental quality in the Georgetown and Environs by providing adequate solid waste disposal through the construction and operation of a new sanitary landfill at Eccles following a safe technical and environmental closing of the old controlled landfill at Mandela avenue.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
